            "value" : "The destination folder must not already exist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The diagnostic list includes repository and user helpers. Available means the executable is present; actual credential success is confirmed only by a successful Git operation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "诊断列表包含仓库级和用户级凭证助手。“可用”只表示可执行文件存在；实际凭证成功只能通过成功完成一次 Git 操作确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The diagnostic list includes repository and user helpers. Transport continues to use the system Git credential flow." : {
