          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These checks run before single-root and multi-root Commit. Continue or cancel is offered for each warning group; choosing not to warn again disables that warning for this project." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些检查在单 root 和多 root Commit 前运行。每组警告都会提供继续或取消；选择不再警告会为此项目禁用该警告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These policies apply when another process creates or deletes files in a Git worktree. Reliable paired renames route both endpoints through the same Add/Remove policy; ambiguous renames remain refresh-only for safety." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当其他进程在 Git 工作区创建或删除文件时应用这些策略。可靠成对的重命名会让两端走同一 Add/Remove 策略；不明确的重命名出于安全仅刷新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This applies only to a non-current local source branch that is not protected. Remote branches, protected branches, and revision-only merges are kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设置仅适用于未保护的非当前本地源分支。远程分支、受保护分支和仅指定修订版本的合并都会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This branch is already merged in every eligible repository." : {
