            "value" : "等待中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a Push of the checked-out branch is rejected because the remote is ahead, Arbor updates the project roots with the selected Update method and retries. Force pushes, custom refspecs, non-current branches, and branches without an upstream remain manual." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当检出分支的 Push 因远程领先而被拒绝时，Arbor 会用选定的 Update 方式更新项目 roots 并重试。强制 Push、自定义 refspec、非当前分支以及无上游的分支仍需手动处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When disabled, linear Drop Commit actions execute immediately after their safety checks. Root, merge, protected, and non-current-history commits remain unavailable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时，线性 Drop Commit 操作会在安全检查后立即执行。Root、merge、受保护以及非当前历史的提交仍不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When disabled, remote operations use Arbor's credential dialog instead of configured Git credential helpers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭后，远程操作会使用 Arbor 的凭证对话框，而不是已配置的 Git 凭证助手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When disabled, this project inherits the global protected branch settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭后，此项目继承全局受保护分支设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, a successful update with received commits opens the dedicated Update Info Log tab. Disable this to keep the current Log tab and use View Commits from the notification." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用后，收到提交的成功更新会打开专用 Update Info Log 标签页。关闭此选项则保留当前 Log 标签页，并使用通知中的 View Commits。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, all Arbor commit, amend, and commit-and-push operations pass Git's --no-verify behavior. The per-commit checkbox remains checked and is disabled while this override is active." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用后，所有 Arbor commit、amend 和 commit-and-push 操作都会传递 Git 的 --no-verify 行为。此覆盖生效期间，每次提交的复选框会保持勾选并禁用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, an Unshelve without an explicit target creates or reuses a Changelist named after the Shelf description. IntelliJ keeps this option off by default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用后，没有明确目标的 Unshelve 会按 Shelf 描述创建或复用同名变更列表。IntelliJ 默认关闭此选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, the identity applies to all Git repositories unless a repository has its own local override." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用后，除非仓库有自己的本地覆盖，否则身份应用于所有 Git 仓库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When force push is selected, protect against overwriting a remote update unless you explicitly turn lease off in the Push dialog." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择强制推送时，默认防止覆盖远程更新；如需关闭 lease，请在 Push 对话框中明确取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When typing a new branch or Push target, invalid Git ref characters are removed and spaces/control characters are replaced with this symbol. The default is '-'." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "输入新分支或 Push 目标时，无效 Git ref 字符会被移除，空格/控制字符会替换为此符号。默认值为 '-'。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
